* `max_data`: set to 0 to indicate that there is no maximum data.
* `send_window`: set to 0 to indicate that there is no send window.
* `recv_window`: set to 0 to indicate that there is no receive window.
* `stream_data`: set to 0 to indicate that there is no stream data.

